{"ref": "3.1", "original": "Δικαίων δὲ ψυχαὶ ἐν χειρὶ θεοῦ, καὶ οὐ μὴ ἅψηται αὐτῶν βάσανος.", "title": "하나님의 손에 있는 의인", "korean": "의인들의 영혼은 하나님의 손에 있으니, 고통이 그들에게 결코 닿지 못할 것이다.", "sourceUrl": "https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0527.tlg033.1st1K-grc1:3.1/", "groups": [], "notes": ["서로 이어지는 3.1-3을 한 문맥으로 읽는다. 3.2-3의 인간적 평가와 의인의 상태가 대비된다.", "3.2의 마침표와 3.3의 εὰσιν은 전자텍스트의 오류다. Swete 인쇄본의 해당 대목을 대조하여 쉼표와 εἰσιν으로 바로잡았다. 인쇄본: archive.org/details/oldtestamentingr02swetuoft/page/n624/mode/1up."], "source_revision": "sha256:1cdb0b5684cae08cb9c3a44a6b533654fc7bc35ba674ea6393c13d4038911ee0", "translation_revision": "sha256:34b0a159911501f1c4e46e3f5648b3001b3ad1a25520e8b127427d5050818969", "work_passage_id": "wisdom:3.1", "html_path": "works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-1", "fixed_html_path": "releases/public-0.3/works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-1", "source_language": "grc", "source_kind": "edited_ancient_original", "alignment_revision": "sha256:d59d14dcbf28659530cd92e7ebf1b20042f495de3dddf447506fcd0761dfbc4f", "review_state": {"human_reviewed": false, "translation": "ai_authored", "source_check": "pinned_xml_extraction", "targets": {"source_revision": "sha256:1cdb0b5684cae08cb9c3a44a6b533654fc7bc35ba674ea6393c13d4038911ee0", "translation_revision": "sha256:34b0a159911501f1c4e46e3f5648b3001b3ad1a25520e8b127427d5050818969", "alignment_revision": "sha256:d59d14dcbf28659530cd92e7ebf1b20042f495de3dddf447506fcd0761dfbc4f"}}, "rights": {"source": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source_url": "https://github.com/OpenGreekAndLatin/First1KGreek/blob/8ee111eb44ecef4120c844e10749178d95d1f30c/data/tlg0527/tlg033/tlg0527.tlg033.1st1K-grc1.xml", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/", "translation": "original_language_translation_public_review_edition"}, "citation": {"author": "익명", "work": "솔로몬의 지혜", "reference": "3.1", "edition": "Henry Barclay Swete 편, The Old Testament in Greek 2, Cambridge University Press, 1896.", "release": "public-0.3", "translation_revision": "sha256:34b0a159911501f1c4e46e3f5648b3001b3ad1a25520e8b127427d5050818969", "fixed_path": "releases/public-0.3/works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-1"}}
{"ref": "3.2", "original": "ἔδοξαν ἐν ὀφθαλμοῖς ἀφρόνων τεθνάναι, καὶ ἐλογίσθη κάκωσις ἡ ἔξοδος αὐτῶν,", "title": "죽음을 바라보는 눈", "korean": "어리석은 사람들의 눈에는 그들이 죽은 것처럼 보였고, 그들의 떠남은 재난으로 여겨졌다.", "sourceUrl": "https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0527.tlg033.1st1K-grc1:3.2/", "groups": [], "notes": [], "source_revision": "sha256:90d6ad4367423c882099bb1a970483a83bfbaf1daaa9e5c35c1ad9e73579fc23", "translation_revision": "sha256:b61cb817d1ad4e413f80152197edc31ab531e793c31519d01051c715be9dbed7", "work_passage_id": "wisdom:3.2", "html_path": "works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-2", "fixed_html_path": "releases/public-0.3/works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-2", "source_language": "grc", "source_kind": "edited_ancient_original", "alignment_revision": "sha256:228112f7ec7e733acc0f0d8c852e01265b2f58ca8fcb93d11a4a879ee455aa03", "review_state": {"human_reviewed": false, "translation": "ai_authored", "source_check": "pinned_xml_extraction", "targets": {"source_revision": "sha256:90d6ad4367423c882099bb1a970483a83bfbaf1daaa9e5c35c1ad9e73579fc23", "translation_revision": "sha256:b61cb817d1ad4e413f80152197edc31ab531e793c31519d01051c715be9dbed7", "alignment_revision": "sha256:228112f7ec7e733acc0f0d8c852e01265b2f58ca8fcb93d11a4a879ee455aa03"}}, "rights": {"source": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source_url": "https://github.com/OpenGreekAndLatin/First1KGreek/blob/8ee111eb44ecef4120c844e10749178d95d1f30c/data/tlg0527/tlg033/tlg0527.tlg033.1st1K-grc1.xml", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/", "translation": "original_language_translation_public_review_edition"}, "citation": {"author": "익명", "work": "솔로몬의 지혜", "reference": "3.2", "edition": "Henry Barclay Swete 편, The Old Testament in Greek 2, Cambridge University Press, 1896.", "release": "public-0.3", "translation_revision": "sha256:b61cb817d1ad4e413f80152197edc31ab531e793c31519d01051c715be9dbed7", "fixed_path": "releases/public-0.3/works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-2"}}
{"ref": "3.3", "original": "καὶ ἡ ἀφʼ ἡμῶν πορεία σύντριμμα· οἱ δέ εἰσιν ἐν εἰρήνῃ.", "title": "의인들의 평안", "korean": "우리에게서 떠나간 것은 파멸로 여겨졌다. 그러나 그들은 평안 가운데 있다.", "sourceUrl": "https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0527.tlg033.1st1K-grc1:3.3/", "groups": [], "notes": [], "source_revision": "sha256:be8832d6ac6397e0a6cd8164c5d4b3cc78eedb97f02228a186a1b78dcae100b0", "translation_revision": "sha256:ffbcb396a1e43991ea37abbc02fd5f7ff28c888979a08b381baac5dce8514348", "work_passage_id": "wisdom:3.3", "html_path": "works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-3", "fixed_html_path": "releases/public-0.3/works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-3", "source_language": "grc", "source_kind": "edited_ancient_original", "alignment_revision": "sha256:9f043bbc01e1ebef003cb6685c63470a955fb691e01cb330f0eef1ef95bae075", "review_state": {"human_reviewed": false, "translation": "ai_authored", "source_check": "pinned_xml_extraction", "targets": {"source_revision": "sha256:be8832d6ac6397e0a6cd8164c5d4b3cc78eedb97f02228a186a1b78dcae100b0", "translation_revision": "sha256:ffbcb396a1e43991ea37abbc02fd5f7ff28c888979a08b381baac5dce8514348", "alignment_revision": "sha256:9f043bbc01e1ebef003cb6685c63470a955fb691e01cb330f0eef1ef95bae075"}}, "rights": {"source": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "source_url": "https://github.com/OpenGreekAndLatin/First1KGreek/blob/8ee111eb44ecef4120c844e10749178d95d1f30c/data/tlg0527/tlg033/tlg0527.tlg033.1st1K-grc1.xml", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/", "translation": "original_language_translation_public_review_edition"}, "citation": {"author": "익명", "work": "솔로몬의 지혜", "reference": "3.3", "edition": "Henry Barclay Swete 편, The Old Testament in Greek 2, Cambridge University Press, 1896.", "release": "public-0.3", "translation_revision": "sha256:ffbcb396a1e43991ea37abbc02fd5f7ff28c888979a08b381baac5dce8514348", "fixed_path": "releases/public-0.3/works/wisdom/index.html#p-3-3"}}
